      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chaseburg%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The topography of Chaseburg creates a split-level layout, with the two sections representing early Norwegian and German settlements.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://driftlesswisconsin.com/chaseburg/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Lower Chaseburg is almost like an island, surrounded by Coon Creek and accessible only via three bridges.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        29
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://driftlesswisconsin.com/chaseburg/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lower Chaseburg features a public grounds area with Tuffy Pond and an open walk space.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
